      "description": "Stage and call checkpoints of computations/deltalambda/rev_e_infinity_xbot_relaxation_probe.py, a ~200-minute probe run inside a 120-minute harness window, stored so a killed run resumes in any container. One orphan branch per git state of the probe's import cone (the probe, the evaluator it execs, and qou_substrate; the probe refuses the store if any other module from the checkout is loaded); inside it, content-addressed JSONL shards of record name -> the probe's own record, where each record name carries a SHA-256 of the probe source up to that stage, the committed evaluator, the q0 string, mp.dps and every REV_XBOT* override. mpf values are exact `_mpf_` tuples (hex mantissa), never a float. Before 2026-11-22 the records were per-file JSON under ~/.cache/qou/xbot-relaxation-ckpt, which is still the fallback when a file in the cone is dirty (no source key, so the branch store is off). Read and written through the shared layer (scripts/lib/branch-cache.sh, computations/_branch_cache.py); it restores by default but seeds origin only when QOU_XBOT_CKPT_CACHE_PUSH=1. `xbot-relaxation-ckpt/` is where a member is mounted; nothing is tracked there. The kind is `typologies/xbot-relaxation-ckpt.json`.",
